sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant HR as HR export
    participant RUN as Reconciliation worker
    participant DISK as Spill files
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant OPS as Operator
    HR->>RUN: Upload CSV + asOf, optional expected count
    RUN->>DB: Create UPLOADED run, transition to DIFFING
    RUN->>DISK: Stream validated rows into 256 CRC32 buckets
    Note over RUN,DISK: Reject bad rows, valid IDs still count as present
    loop One bucket at a time
        RUN->>DISK: Read one bucket
        RUN->>DB: Read matching employee bucket
        RUN->>DB: Save CREATE / UPDATE / HEAL / ADVANCE / DEACTIVATE plan
    end
    RUN->>RUN: Check row counts and missing-active thresholds
    alt Brake trips on a non-dry run
        RUN->>DB: AWAITING_APPROVAL + alert, zero actions applied
        DB-->>OPS: Plan, missing count and recorded threshold
        OPS->>RUN: Approve ALL / SKIP_DEACTIVATIONS, or reject
    end
    opt Safe or approved non-dry run
        loop Chunks of 40, one transaction per chunk
            RUN->>DB: Lock only chunk employees, recheck versions and status
            RUN->>DB: Batch employee/action/outbox writes, COMMIT
        end
        RUN->>DB: COMPLETED
    end
    Note over RUN,DB: Dry-run ends PLANNED, rejected plan ends REJECTED
    RUN->>DISK: Remove spill directory, retain upload for seven-day audit
